{"id": "sf-plumbing-permit-after-state-license-revocation", "title": "A San Francisco permit listed a contractor licence after California reported revoking it", "seconds": 49.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "496ae963b786aec1", "words": 143, "beats": [{"scene": "dates", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "California’s contractor register lists a plumbing license revoked on May 2, 2024.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.51, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "was", "the", "license", "status", "when", "the", "permit", "was", "issued?"], "sub": "San Francisco plumbing permit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.65, 1.28, 1.76, 2.06, 2.18, 2.55, 2.95, 3.38, 3.56, 3.79, 4.33, 4.69]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 5.63, "t1": 6.96, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A lead, not a finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.32, 0.4, 0.67, 0.83, 0.91]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The signed order barred applications for reissuance or reinstatement for five years.", "t0": 7.08, "t1": 11.63, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "California Contractors State License Board", "text": "Signed revocation order", "mark": "Signed revocation order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.55, 0.9, 1.21, 1.88, 2.07, 2.65, 2.79, 3.44, 3.61, 3.9]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "50 days later, the City recorded an application with the same license number and holder.", "t0": 11.75, "t1": 16.91, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "The same license number and holder", "heading": "State register and City application", "source": "register", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "State revocation", "value": "May 2, 2024"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "City application", "value": "June 21, 2024"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.65, 1.32, 1.5, 1.79, 2.26, 2.4, 3.08, 3.24, 3.35, 3.63, 4.03, 4.33, 4.48]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City issued the permit June 25 and marked it complete on December 12.", "t0": 17.03, "t1": 22.04, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "permit", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "June 2024 permit", "mark": "June 2024 permit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.57, 0.91, 1.02, 1.47, 1.75, 2.58, 2.88, 3.16, 3.26, 3.74, 3.9, 4.34]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The July 11 rough inspection and the December 12 final mechanical inspection were both approved.", "t0": 22.16, "t1": 27.65, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "job", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "City inspection report", "mark": "City inspection report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.46, 0.85, 1.06, 1.98, 2.23, 2.33, 2.75, 3.11, 3.41, 3.92, 4.49, 4.68, 4.92]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state law then in effect required a signed declaration of licensure or exemption.", "t0": 27.87, "t1": 32.25, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "law", "kicker": "California Contractors State License Board", "text": "2024 licensing declaration", "mark": "2024 licensing declaration"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.54, 0.9, 1.13, 1.24, 1.61, 2.03, 2.13, 2.46, 3.0, 3.11, 3.65, 3.79]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The public permit entry does not show what the applicant declared.", "t0": 32.37, "t1": 35.56, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The signed declaration"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.85, 1.15, 1.35, 1.58, 1.92, 2.08, 2.21, 2.65]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The license history, signed declaration and job card could show who was authorized and who did the work.", "t0": 35.68, "t1": 41.33, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["License history", "Signed declaration", "Job card"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 1.26, 1.63, 2.23, 2.35, 2.63, 2.94, 3.14, 3.38, 3.54, 3.71, 4.48, 4.77, 4.96, 5.15, 5.26]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The matching records do not establish that unlicensed work occurred or that public money was lost.", "t0": 41.45, "t1": 46.78, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "What the records establish"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.51, 0.87, 1.0, 1.18, 1.69, 1.89, 2.49, 2.78, 3.59, 3.8, 4.0, 4.36, 4.6, 4.79]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 46.9, "t1": 48.87, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.39, 0.49, 0.58, 1.01, 1.19, 1.29]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"dates": "Match the license number and dates", "declaration": "What did the applicant declare?"}, "look": "map", "hook": "question"}